meta {
  name: Host detail + policy results
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleet/hosts/identifier/{{hostUuid}}?populate_policies=true
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Mirrors fleetdm.ts:173 - the single call that returns a host WITH its
  per-policy pass/fail rows. The default hostUuid is SG-TEST, the synthetic
  host that never answers, so the "Disk encryption" policy result stays null:
  that null is the point (unknown raises assurance, never lowers it), not a
  broken fixture.
}
